{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"除幂结构"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"除幂结构"},2],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>固定环 $A$ 和理想 $I$. 一个除幂结构 (divided power structure) 是一族映射 $\\gamma_n\\colon I\\to A\\,(n\\geq 0)$, 满足</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$\\gamma_0(x)=1$,</li>\n<li>$\\gamma_1(x)=x$,</li>\n<li>$\\gamma_n(x)\\in I\\,(n\\geq 1)$,</li>\n<li>$\\gamma_n(x+y)=\\sum_{i+j=n}\\gamma_i(x)\\gamma_j(y)$,</li>\n<li>$\\gamma_n(\\lambda x)=\\lambda ^n\\gamma_n(x)$,</li>\n<li>$\\gamma_i(x)\\gamma_j(x)=\\binom{i+j}{i}\\gamma_{i+j}(x)$,</li>\n<li>$\\gamma_i(\\gamma_j(x))=\\dfrac{(ij)!}{i!(j!)^i}\\gamma_{ij}(x)$.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>例</h2>\n"}}